    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple 2D action escape puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are very easy and simple stages. You have to change the player's color to progress and avoid obstacles to clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple control method is to press the left and right arrow keys and the space bar to jump, and press the r, b, g, y keys to change colors and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a good time-killer that doesn't take too long.</p>",
